WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
I'm gonna try out the Rare Soft Pinch
Blush in shade Hope.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.100
I got it from Sephora Thailand,

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.060
and I didn't know how this gonna be
and how much pigment it's gonna give me,

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.480
so I got it in mini size.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.180
Hope. My hopes are high,

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:19.560
because I like my blush really high.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.020
It's good.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.240
Am I gonna buy the big size of this one?

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.400
I would say no, because I already
have a small one.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.220
Maybe a little bit darker shade,
a little bit darker color.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.600
That would be more brown-skin-friendly.
